  "cited_article_id": "configure-provider-calendar",
  "reply": "To update the provider’s working hours and add any needed calendar blocks, go to **Settings > Scheduling > Provider Hours**, select the clinician from the **Provider** dropdown, adjust the weekly start/end times or check **Day Off** for non‑working days, click **Add Block** to set one‑time unavailable periods, choose a reason, and then click **Save Changes**. If the availability still looks wrong, clear your browser cache and confirm there are no conflicting group‑schedule overrides under **Settings > Scheduling > Facility Hours**, and that the provider’s time zone matches your clinic’s main location."
}
